~ initialize_local_variables

=> start

~ start
Shopkeeper: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_shh")]Be quiet. My daughter's asleep. 
Shopkeeper: She's been helping me out all day and I'd hate for us to wake her up with our chatter. 
Shopkeeper: Anyway, you're finally here! You sure took your time. 
Shopkeeper: I know who you are and why you've come. The Goddess told me. 
Shopkeeper: There's no need to get into it right now. You're surely exhausted. We've got time. 
Shopkeeper: That there's your room. I've readied a change of clothes and a warm bath for you. 
Shopkeeper: Get some sleep. Tomorrow we wake early. Lots of work to be done.
Shopkeeper: I'm sure you've got loads of questions for me. Don't worry, I'll answer each and every one of them, as best I can. 
Shopkeeper: I'll see you in the morning. 
- Alright then. 
	Sarah: [wait=1.5]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
- Thank you for having me.
	Shopkeeper: Oh, it's my pleasure. You're chosen. You'll be a huge help. 
	Sarah: [wait=1.5]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad
- Weird welcoming party. 
	Shopkeeper: Hah. I know. You'll have to forgive me. 
	Shopkeeper: Hospitality is usually my strong suit. I'll make it up to you. 
	Sarah: [wait=1]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad
		
		
~ dad
Shopkeeper: Hells. Go back to sleep, darling. Everything's fine. 
Sarah: [#sprite=upset][do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_sniff")]I've had one of those dreams again... They're back. 
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Back to bed. I'm right behind you. 
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried][wait=0.6]...Have to go. See you tomorrow. 
- Sorry I woke her up.
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]No harm done. It wasn't you. 
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END 
- All good?
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Yeah, don't worry about it. Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END
- Night. 
	Shopkeeper: Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END

=> END

